 "description": "The full SchoolScope profile for one school by slug: verdict and archetype, Scope Score with band and percentile per level, CAASPP exceeded/met split, cohort growth (school-by-grade aggregates two years apart, in SBAC scale-score points, reported as a 0-100 index centred on the state average), climate (absenteeism, suspension, ELPAC), equity gaps by student group, teacher stability, and \u2014 for high schools \u2014 graduation, college destinations, UC admissions history, AP courses, and IB programmes. Also answers \"is this school improving?\" with a year-over-year table of statewide percentile and the underlying rates; the Scope Score is excluded there because it is normalised within each year and is not comparable across them. Current data year 2025.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
